busercontent.com/u/144669732?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000","html_url":"https://github.com/Minus4000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T16:07:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T16:07:45Z","body":"> Does it work correctly without Wayland? Or is it Wayland specific?\n\n\nMy reply was wrong:\n> So far I have only tested this on Wayland.\n\nApparently, all of my tests so far were actually running on X11, even though my desktop session is running on Wayland. \nI also cannot switch the display server in Godot 4.7.1. `DisplayServer.get_name()` always returns `X11`, even when the project is set to use Wayland. When set to Headless, however, it correctly returns `headless`.\nI testet it on Godot 4.3, where I was able to switch to wayland. I forked and built godot today, there I was able to switch between x11 and wayland as well, so this issue should already be fixed in newer builds.\n\nI tested the MRP with `display/display_server/driver.linuxbsd` set to `wayland` using my custom build. It produced the same results as `X11`.\n\nI also tested the MRP on Godot 4.3 with `display/display_server/driver.linuxbsd` set to `wayland` , and it produced the same results. However, this test may not be reliable because errors like this one were thrown:\n\n```text\nE 0:00:00:0989   node.gd:50 @ print_key_data(): Not supported by this display server.\n  <C++-Fehler>   Method/function failed. Returning: p_keycode\n  <C++-Quelle>   servers/display_server.cpp:689 @ keyboard_get_label_from_physical()\n  <Stacktrace>   node.gd:50 @ print_key_data()\n                 node.gd:24 @ _ready()\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5397946003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5397987455","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122740#issuecomment-5397987455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122740","id":5397987455,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQb7Afw","user":{"login":"Minus4000","id":144669732,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJ98JA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144669732?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000","html_url":"https://github.com/Minus4000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Minus4000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T16:11:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T16:11:13Z","body":"Should I update the title of the issue, since it also affects X11